('74637c51-24a8-4a46-b2ce-334ce6eb26ee','abeb3fe7-d61f-4f28-a078-6e4a9196627f','user','Hu','2026-06-10 13:55:19.146354'),
('f680973a-370c-4774-8fa8-813c780a19d1','abeb3fe7-d61f-4f28-a078-6e4a9196627f','ai','Hello! How can I help you with your NEET preparation on NEETIQ Prime today? Whether it\'s about our Daily DPPs, mock tests, or your wallet balance, I\'m here to assist. Let me know how I can support your learning journey!','2026-06-10 13:55:21.349786'),
('fc4d8d3b-6cea-4468-ad26-4c6c998b0fbc','abeb3fe7-d61f-4f28-a078-6e4a9196627f','user','Who are you?','2026-06-10 13:55:32.783746'),
('969883cc-4ef9-4bb7-a2f1-11c22dbb1a3f','abeb3fe7-d61f-4f28-a078-6e4a9196627f','ai','I am NEETIQ Support, your friendly assistant for the NEETIQ Prime prep app. I can help you with features like Daily DPPs, AI-generated quizzes, mock tests, and managing your wallet or subscription. How can I assist you with your prep today?','2026-06-10 13:55:35.199549'),
('7ea0589c-33bc-4005-b975-5209dded56ec','abeb3fe7-d61f-4f28-a078-6e4a9196627f','user','What are the features of it','2026-06-10 13:55:44.609392'),
('f64ab85a-f815-42e3-beef-4786aa13e065','abeb3fe7-d61f-4f28-a078-6e4a9196627f','ai','Feel free to explore the app and start practicing! If you have any questions about your progress or the contests, just let me know. Happy learning!','2026-06-10 13:56:19.977411'),
('f983dd0a-9e11-48f8-8650-b3d862ef95ec','abeb3fe7-d61f-4f28-a078-6e4a9196627f','ai','NEETIQ Prime offers Daily DPPs, AI-generated quizzes, full Mock Tests, PYQs, and live cash-prize Contests. You also get weekly analytics, a referral program with bonuses, and a wallet for easy withdrawals (min ₹50). Premium members enjoy unlimited custom tests and access to all paid mock exams!','2026-06-10 13:55:46.759953'),
('096dc287-f22b-4e8c-b618-e0e4b69029e3','abeb3fe7-d61f-4f28-a078-6e4a9196627f','user','Oh ok...','2026-06-10 13:56:16.421138'),
('ce7de80b-a871-4643-be77-775f608e0ee7','abeb3fe7-d61f-4f28-a078-6e4a9196627f','ai','I apologize that I couldn\'t assist you as expected. While I handle app-related support, our app\'s AI tool is designed specifically to generate your practice questions. I can connect you to the team — tap the team button below.','2026-06-10 13:57:32.687666'),
('4f5daad8-4bdd-4031-937d-df5e623ecc8a','abeb3fe7-d61f-4f28-a078-6e4a9196627f','user','What you can do','2026-06-10 13:56:53.211133'),
('9d654457-b3f1-4e13-8530-2f7edb179d84','abeb3fe7-d61f-4f28-a078-6e4a9196627f','ai','I can help you navigate features like Daily DPPs, mock tests, and AI-generated quizzes to boost your NEET prep. I can also assist with wallet queries, referral bonuses, or explaining how to join live cash-prize contests. If you have a specific issue I can’t solve, I can connect you to the team — tap the team button below.','2026-06-10 13:56:56.132463'),
('1f1bb437-9c36-453a-9805-c699096a67f0','abeb3fe7-d61f-4f28-a078-6e4a9196627f','user','Generate a question','2026-06-10 13:57:07.24921'),
('e8202cab-a653-4920-a17d-a55ff1ffce30','abeb3fe7-d61f-4f28-a078-6e4a9196627f','ai','I can\'t generate specific academic questions here, but you can use our **AI-generated quizzes** or **Daily DPP** features directly in the app to get tailored practice questions. Simply head to the "Generated Tests" section to create a custom quiz on any topic. I can help you with any questions about how to use those features!','2026-06-10 13:57:09.618411'),
('9d08ad08-5896-4669-80c0-3dadd35e7ae9','abeb3fe7-d61f-4f28-a078-6e4a9196627f','user','You are not helpful','2026-06-10 13:57:30.519107'),
